        "move_id": "",
        "description": "Auto-generated from selected effects:\n\n- Item Rocky Helmet:\nIf the bearer is hit by a physical attack, the attacker also takes damage.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Contact attackers lose 1/6 max HP.\n- Fling base power: 60.\n\n- Item Toxic Orb:\nStrange sphere that seriously poisons those who use it in combat.It must be carried by a Pokémon.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Fling base power: 30.\n\n- Item Yache Berry:\nIf carried by a Pokémon, it weakens super-effective Ice-type attacks.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Fling base power: 10.\n\n- Move Hone Claws:\nThe user sharpens their claws to increase their Attack and Accuracy.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Accuracy: no standard accuracy roll (self-target or guaranteed effect).\n- Base PP: 15.\n- Raises Attack and Accuracy of user by 1 stage.\n- Internal function code: RaiseUserAtkAcc1.\n\n- Ability Thick Fat:\nThanks to the thick layer of fat that protects it, it reduces the damage received from Fire and Ice type attacks by half.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Fire- and Ice-type damage taken is halved (0.5x).",
        "consumable": false,
        "show_quantity": true
